---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About The AI Duet — field notes and services from the intersection of Chinese AI and global markets.">
  <section class="page">
    <div class="page-inner">
      <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          <strong>The AI Duet</strong> is a publication, podcast, and services studio focused on
          Chinese AI companies going global. Based in Singapore — at the crossroads of China
          and the rest of the world — it captures the stories, strategies, and hard-won lessons
          of founders navigating the space between two ecosystems.
        </p>

        <p>
          The name reflects what this work is: a duet between two worlds. Chinese founders
          building for global markets. Local ecosystems adapting to new players. The conversation
          between what works in China and what works everywhere else.
        </p>

        <h2>Who's behind this</h2>

        <p>
          I'm Ellen — an entrepreneur, writer, and connector based in Singapore. My work sits
          at the intersection of AI, go-to-market strategy, and the China–global corridor.
        </p>

        <p>
          I run <a href="https://flos.global" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Flos</a> (AI GTM consulting
          and marketplace), co-run <strong>Semmering</strong> (investment banking advisory for AI startups),
          and produce <strong>离线时间</strong>, a Chinese-language podcast featuring in-depth
          conversations with AI founders building globally.
        </p>

        <p>
          Previously, I ran a USD-denominated VC fund in Beijing, was an early TEDx China
          ambassador, and studied International Relations and Economics at Peking University.
          I've spent a decade watching Chinese technology companies figure out how to go global —
          The AI Duet is where I share what I've learned.
        </p>

        <h2>Get in touch</h2>

        <p>
          I'm always interested in connecting with founders, investors, and anyone curious
          about the Chinese AI ecosystem. Reach me at
          <a href="mailto:ellen@theaiduet.com">ellen@theaiduet.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { padding: 80px var(--spacing-page); }
  .page-inner { max-width: var(--prose-width); margin: 0 auto; }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .prose { font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.85; }
  .prose :global(p) { margin-bottom: 24px; color: #1e293b; }
  .prose :global(h2) {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 400;
    margin-top: 48px; margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .prose :global(a) { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 2px; }
  .prose :global(strong) { font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page { padding: 48px 20px; }
    .page-title { font-size: 32px; }
  }
</style>
